{"2954040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nova Forever", "steam_appid": 2954040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.poster.avif?t=1780059438\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.webm?t=1780059438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming <strong>buddy comedy adventure</strong> set in a colorful  utopian space mall. <strong>Explore</strong> casinos, hotels, bars, gardens, a nonsensical trade show, and touch some synthetic grass. A <strong>fully voiced</strong> ensemble of <strong>quirky characters</strong>. <strong>Cinematic cut-scenes</strong> and an <strong>original synth-heavy score</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/79945c8c23c71e15353e7c21cbab593f.poster.avif?t=1780059438\" width=1170 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/79945c8c23c71e15353e7c21cbab593f.webm?t=1780059438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are <i>Cargo</i>. An alien with a heart of gold and dreams made of stars. When a freak transporter accident fuses his mind with his idol — the legendary, presumed-dead scientist <i>Nova Cassidy</i>, Cargo's plans to start a new life are put on hold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova concludes the sinister <strong><i>TEAL Corporation</i></strong> sabotaged her, which now controls <strong><i>The Plaza</i></strong>, turning it from the place of scientific progress Nova once envisioned, into a space mall with bars, shops, hotels, casinos and many more questionable attractions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cargo loves this place</strong> <strong>— Nova hates it! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Can they work through their differences to bring Nova back to reality?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/b0fd8bfc71f0e6ca3a483de43db17da6.poster.avif?t=1780059438\" width=1170 height=1200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/b0fd8bfc71f0e6ca3a483de43db17da6.webm?t=1780059438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.poster.avif?t=1780059438\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954040/extras/ffb77c879f053f9f90dfa03b9280b7b0.webm?t=1780059438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming <strong>buddy comedy adventure</strong> set in a colorful  utopian space mall. <strong>Explore</strong> casinos, hotels, bars, gardens, a nonsensical trade show, and touch some synthetic grass. A <strong>fully voiced</strong> ensemble of <strong>quirky characters</strong>. <strong>Cinematic cut-scenes</strong> and an <strong>original synth-heavy score</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><